{
  "about": "Problems the handbook already explains. A problem whose report holds one of an entry's phrases (lower case, after numbers are taken out) is documented: the box and the installer point at the page instead of offering a report. Read by backend/plugins/report/src/known.rs; the pages are under handbook/docs/.",
